      },
      "golden": "<button type=\"button\" data-ripple class=\"pa-btn pa-btn--primary pa-btn--ripple\">Ripple</button>",
      "note": "pa-btn--ripple is the CSS base; data-ripple is the runtime hook the ripple JS keys off to add pa-btn--ripple-active on click. It's a PRESENCE flag — value is irrelevant — so the normalizer treats data-ripple as boolean (svelte emits =\"true\", keen emits =\"\"; both ≡ bare)."
    },
    {
